  devSolutionReport: "DEVELOPER SOLUTION REPORT (spoilers: never shown to players)\r\nlayout
    seed 42069, scenario seed 1, attempt 1; start in player_start.0\r\n\r\nEscape
    pods\r\n  escape_pod_bay.0: Operational, quiet slow manual release\r\n  escape_pod_bay.1:
    Operational, loud countdown launch, needs ship power\r\n\r\nGated doors\r\n 
    engineering.0--escape_pod_bay.1 (door in escape_pod_bay.1): Remote(control room
    4)  - a security lockdown door, released from the security station\r\n  quarantine.0--security.0
    (door in quarantine.0): Keycard  - a keycard door\r\n  food_storage.0--mess_hall.0
    (door in food_storage.0): Keycard OR Override  - a keycard door, with a loud
    manual override\r\n\r\nConsoles\r\n  PodLaunch: escape_pod_bay.0 / anchor podlaunchconsole\r\n 
    PodLaunch: escape_pod_bay.1 / anchor podlaunchconsole\r\n  RemoteDoor: security.0
    / anchor doorcontrolconsole (operates the door on engineering.0--escape_pod_bay.1)\r\n 
    FuseSocket: power_control.0 / anchor fusesocket\r\n  Generator: engineering.0
    / anchor generator_console\r\n\r\nItem placements (one candidate is picked each
    round from the round seed)\r\n  keycard [CRITICAL] Keycard:\r\n    crew_quarters.0
    / bedsidesurface_1 (BedsideSurface) weight 0.5  - CrewQuarters/BedsideSurface
    (displaced): left on a bunk\r\n    crew_quarters.1 / bedsidesurface_0 (BedsideSurface)
    weight 0.5  - CrewQuarters/BedsideSurface (displaced): left on a bunk\r\n   
    security.0 / securitydesk_1 (SecurityDesk) weight 3.0  - Security/SecurityDesk:
    left on a security desk\r\n    crew_quarters.0 / bedsidesurface_3 (BedsideSurface)
    weight 0.5  - CrewQuarters/BedsideSurface (displaced): left on a bunk\r\n  fuse
    [CRITICAL] Fuse:\r\n    power_control.0 / engineeringrack_2 (EngineeringRack)
    weight 4.2  - PowerControl/EngineeringRack: spares kept in the switchgear\r\n   
    cargo_bay.0 / cargoshelving_6 (CargoShelving) weight 0.75  - CargoBay/CargoShelving
    (displaced): stocked as cargo spares\r\n    workshop.0 / workshopbench_0 (WorkshopBench)
    weight 3.0  - Workshop/WorkshopBench: left on a workbench mid-repair\r\n    maintenance_room.0
    / generalstorage_0 (GeneralStorage) weight 0.7  - MaintenanceRoom/GeneralStorage:
    maintenance spares\r\n  noisemaker_0 [optional] Noisemaker:\r\n    cargo_bay.0
    / cargoshelving_7 (CargoShelving) weight 2.25  - CargoBay/CargoShelving: cargo
    equipment\r\n    secondary_cargo_hold.0 / cargoshelving_1 (CargoShelving) weight
