    stage 1: door on edge 22 (food_storage.0--mess_hall.0) can be opened\r\n\r\nIntended
    solutions\r\n  escape_pod_bay.0 (ManualQuiet): 6 rooms away; gates on the shortest-gate
    route: none\r\n  escape_pod_bay.1 (Loud): 4 rooms away; gates on the shortest-gate
